title: "open-tcm-discovery"
abstract: "An open MCP skill server for TCM drug discovery: live multi-database retrieval, ADME screening, network pharmacology, molecular docking (Vina), evidence grading, and clinical trial matching. 54 tools, real-time queries with source tracing, no pre-seeded answers."
